      {
        "id": "textbook-cas-semantics",
        "moduleId": "cas-semantics",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "definition",
        "title": "教材语义",
        "markdown": "某些系统提供比较并交换指令（SPARC 上是 compare-and-swap，x86 上是 compare-and-exchange）。它检测 `ptr` 指向的值是否与 `expected` 相等：相等就把该地址更新为 `new`，否则什么也不做。无论哪种情况，都返回该地址的实际值，让调用者知道执行是否成功。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
            {
              "materialId": "doc-98b367ee24452fe791591fee",
              "blockIds": [
                "block-000365"
              ],
              "headingPath": [
                "关于内存虚拟化的对话",
                "比较并交换"
              ],
              "lineStart": 6725,
              "lineEnd": 6771,
              "assetRefs": [],
              "excerptSha256": "dc39881160b9f57d598e994f3642fb5018ab18592e774b15d6f784f6ec5f4ea8"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "textbook-cas-pseudocode",
        "moduleId": "cas-semantics",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "code",
        "title": "教材伪代码（图 28.3）",
        "markdown": "```c\nint CompareAndSwap(int *ptr, int expected, int new) {\n    int actual = *ptr;\n    if (actual == expected)\n        *ptr = new;\n    return actual;\n}\n```",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "quote",
          "sourceSpans": [
            {
              "materialId": "doc-98b367ee24452fe791591fee",
              "blockIds": [
                "block-000365"
              ],
              "headingPath": [
                "关于内存虚拟化的对话",
                "比较并交换"
              ],
              "lineStart": 6725,
              "lineEnd": 6771,
              "assetRefs": [],
              "excerptSha256": "dc39881160b9f57d598e994f3642fb5018ab18592e774b15d6f784f6ec5f4ea8"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "model-success-failure-trace",
        "moduleId": "cas-semantics",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "mechanism",
        "title": "补充跟踪：成功与失败各一次",
        "markdown": "设 `flag = 0`、`expected = 0`、`new = 1`。\n\n1. 线程 A 调用 `CompareAndSwap(&flag, 0, 1)`：实际值为 0，相等，写入 1 并返回 0。返回值等于 `expected`，说明写入发生，A 获得锁。\n2. 线程 B 随后调用：实际值为 1，不相等，**不写入**，直接返回 1。返回值不等于 `expected`，B 必须重试。\n3. A 释放锁后 `flag` 回到 0，B 的下一次调用读到 0，写入 1 并返回 0，B 获得锁。\n\n因此在一般情形下，成败判据是 `CompareAndSwap(ptr, expected, new) == expected`；只有在标志只取 0/1 且 `expected = 0` 时，“返回 1 即失败”才成立。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "model",
          "basedOnBlockIds": [
            "textbook-cas-semantics",
            "textbook-cas-pseudocode"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "textbook-cas-lock-code",
        "moduleId": "cas-lock-construction",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "code",
        "title": "教材示例：替换 lock()",
        "markdown": "```c\nvoid lock(lock_t *lock) {\n    while (CompareAndSwap(&lock->flag, 0, 1) == 1)\n        ; // spin\n}\n```\n\n其余代码与测试并设置的例子完全一样：检查标志是否为 0，是则原子地交换为 1 获得锁；锁被持有时，竞争线程自旋。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "quote",
          "sourceSpans": [
            {
              "materialId": "doc-98b367ee24452fe791591fee",
              "blockIds": [
                "block-000365"
              ],
              "headingPath": [
                "关于内存虚拟化的对话",
                "比较并交换"
              ],
              "lineStart": 6725,
              "lineEnd": 6771,
              "assetRefs": [],
              "excerptSha256": "dc39881160b9f57d598e994f3642fb5018ab18592e774b15d6f784f6ec5f4ea8"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "model-lock-acquire-path",
        "moduleId": "cas-lock-construction",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "mechanism",
        "title": "补充跟踪：获取路径",
        "markdown": "- **锁空闲（`flag = 0`）**：比较相等，原子写成 1，返回 0，`while` 条件为假，进入临界区。\n- **锁被占用（`flag = 1`）**：比较不等，不写入，返回 1，`while` 为真，继续自旋。\n- **锁被释放（`flag` 回到 0）**：下一个尝试的线程读到 0，写入 1，退出自旋。\n\n比较与写入由同一条原子指令完成，两个线程不可能都观察到 0 之后各自写入 1，互斥性由此得到保证。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "model",
          "basedOnBlockIds": [
            "textbook-cas-lock-code",
            "model-success-failure-trace"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "textbook-cas-versus-test-and-set",
        "moduleId": "cas-versus-test-and-set",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "comparison",
        "title": "教材结论：更强但锁行为等价",
        "markdown": "教材指出，比较并交换比测试并设置更强大，将来讨论无等待同步时会用到这一能力；但如果只用它实现一个简单自旋锁，其行为等价于前面分析过的自旋锁。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
            {
              "materialId": "doc-98b367ee24452fe791591fee",
              "blockIds": [
                "block-000365"
              ],
